# Temporary folders of the Vite build tests (server-bundle, groq-bundle, posthog-bundle,
# inline-bundle and the observability boundary test). A test that times out leaves its folder
# behind, and a format check that runs while a test is in progress must not see it (it broke
# pre-push, cards vertex-public-audit and prepush-bundle-leftover-dirs). Biome reads this file
# (vcs.useIgnoreFile).
.*-bundle-*/
.vite-browser-boundary-*/

# Python build artifacts
*.egg-info/
